x:font-medium x:text-black x:dark:text-gray-100" title="API Clients"><span class="grid grid-cols-[max-content_auto] gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-full h-[1.15em] mt-[0.1em]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M1.01562 0.903198H6.875V6.76257H1.01562V0.903198Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"></path><path d="M13.1162 1.29382L16.2412 6.95804H9.99124L13.1162 1.29382Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"></path><path d="M0.625 13.2079C0.625 14.0885 0.974818 14.933 1.5975 15.5557C2.22018 16.1784 3.06471 16.5282 3.94531 16.5282C4.82591 16.5282 5.67045 16.1784 6.29313 15.5557C6.91581 14.933 7.26562 14.0885 7.26562 13.2079C7.26562 12.3273 6.91581 11.4827 6.29313 10.8601C5.67045 10.2374 4.82591 9.88757 3.94531 9.88757C3.06471 9.88757 2.22018 10.2374 1.5975 10.8601C0.974818 11.4827 0.625 12.3273 0.625 13.2079Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"></path><path d="M9.60782 10.2782H17.0327" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"></path><path d="M9.60782 13.2079H17.0327" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"></path><path d="M9.60782 16.1376H17.0327" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span>API Clients</span></span></div><div class="x:border x:inline-flex x:rounded-md x:items-stretch nextra-border x:float-end x:overflow-hidden"><button class="x:transition x:cursor-pointer x:ps-2 x:pe-1 x:flex x:gap-2 x:text-sm x:font-medium x:items-center" type="button" data-headlessui-state=""><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4C2.89543 15 2 14.1046 2 13V4C2 2.89543 2.89543 2 4 2H13C14.1046 2 15 2.89543 15 4V5"></path></svg>Copy page</button><button class="x:cursor-pointer x:h-7 x:rounded-md x:px-2 x:text-xs x:font-medium x:transition-colors x:text-gray-600 x:dark:text-gray-400 x:rounded-none" id="headlessui-listbox-button-_R_6sl5fivblb_" type="button" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" data-headlessui-state=""><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" width="12" class="x:rotate-90"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div id="nextra-skip-nav"></div><main data-pagefind-body="true"><h1 class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-bold x:mt-2 x:text-4xl">API Clients</h1>
<p class="not-first:mt-[1.5em] leading-[1.65em] text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-200">The <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">api</code> module provides four typed HTTP clients for communicating with Anoma Pay backend services. All clients extend the <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">ApiClient</code> base class which handles response parsing and error wrapping.</p>
<div data-pagefind-ignore="all" class="nextra-code x:relative x:not-first:mt-[1.25em]"><pre class="x:group x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:overflow-x-auto x:subpixel-antialiased x:text-[.9em] x:bg-white x:dark:bg-black x:py-4 x:ring-1 x:ring-inset x:ring-gray-300 x:dark:ring-neutral-700 x:contrast-more:ring-gray-900 x:contrast-more:dark:ring-gray-50 x:contrast-more:contrast-150 x:rounded-md not-prose" tabindex="0"><div class="x:group-hover:opacity-100 x:group-focus:opacity-100 x:opacity-0 x:transition x:focus-within:opacity-100 x:flex x:gap-1 x:absolute x:right-4 x:top-2"><button class="x:transition x:cursor-pointer x:border x:border-gray-300 x:dark:border-neutral-700 x:contrast-more:border-gray-900 x:contrast-more:dark:border-gray-50 x:rounded-md x:p-1.5 x:md:hidden" title="Toggle word wrap" type="button" data-headlessui-state=""><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" height="1em"><path d="M4 19h6v-2H4v2zM20 5H4v2h16V5zm-3 6H4v2h13.25c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2s-.9 2-2 2H15v-2l-3 3l3 3v-2h2c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4z"></path></svg></button></div><code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr"><span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583">import</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8"> {</span></span>
<span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">  TransferBackendClient,</span></span>
<span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">  IndexerClient,</span></span>
<span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">  EnvioClient,</span></span>
<span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">  FeedbackClient,</span></span>
<span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">} </span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583">from</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF"> &quot;@anomaorg/anoma-app-sdk&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">;</span></span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="transferbackendclient" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">TransferBackendClient<a href="#transferbackendclient" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2>
<p class="not-first:mt-[1.5em] leading-[1.65em] text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-200">Communicates with the proving backend. This is the primary client for submitting transactions and monitoring their status.</p>
