<h3 id="methods-2" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-8 x:text-2xl">Methods<a href="#methods-2" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h3>
<h4 id="publicnullifierslogicref-timestamp" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-8 x:text-xl"><code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">publicNullifiers(logicRef, timestamp?)</code><a href="#publicnullifierslogicref-timestamp" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h4>
<p class="not-first:mt-[1.5em] leading-[1.65em] text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-200">Returns all public nullifiers for the given logic reference. Use <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">TRANSFER_LOGIC_VERIFYING_KEY</code> as the <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">logicRef</code> for standard transfer resources. Optionally pass a <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">timestamp</code> to fetch only nullifiers from that Unix timestamp onwards.</p>
