<h2 id="feedbackclient" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">FeedbackClient<a href="#feedbackclient" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2>
<p class="not-first:mt-[1.5em] leading-[1.65em] text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-200">Submits user feedback to the Anoma Pay feedback service.</p>
